ted sandbox to control their execution. Hermit translates normal, nondeterministic behavior, into deterministic, repeatable behavior. This can be used for various applications, including replay-debugging, reproducible artifacts, chaos mode concurrency testing and bug analysis.","fork":true,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/git/commits